<title>ITALY: Parmalat '96 gross op margin up 22pct.</title>
<headline>Parmalat '96 gross op margin up 22pct.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover		    5,465	vs   4,290</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin	   630	vs     518</p>
<p>    Net operating margin	     470	vs     370</p>
<p>    Return on sales		    8.6 pct  vs     8.6 pct</p>
<p>    Cashflow			     370	vs	320</p>
<p>Note - Parmalat Finanziaria said net financial debt at the end of 1996 totalled 802 billion lire.</p>
<p>Technical investments totalled 134 billion and investments in acquisitions totalled 165 billion.</p>
<p>It said its turnover was 38 percent in Italy and 62 percent abroad.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
